{"severity":"warning","file":"errors/deprecated_main_cap_1.march","start_line":4,"start_col":14,"end_line":4,"end_col":29,"message":"`main` asks for its authority with `Cap` parameters, which are deprecated and will be removed in the next release: a capability value grants nothing since the current authority replaced it.\nhelp: request it with a `needs` clause: `fn main() needs IO.Console do`.","code":"deprecated_main_cap","fix":{"kind":"multi","edits":[{"kind":"replace","start_line":4,"start_col":9,"end_line":4,"end_col":30,"text":"()"},{"kind":"replace","start_line":4,"start_col":31,"end_line":4,"end_col":31,"text":"needs IO.Console "}],"applicability":"machine-applicable"},"labels":[],"notes":[],"category":"CAPABILITY"}
